ALGORITHM CLOSEST_PAIR(P)

1. Sort points based on X coordinates.

2. If number of points <= 3:
      Find minimum distance directly.
      Return minimum distance.

3. Divide points into two halves.

4. Find minimum distance in left half.

5. Find minimum distance in right half.

6. Set d = minimum of both distances.

7. Create a strip containing points
   near the dividing line.

8. Sort strip based on Y coordinates.

9. Compare each point with the next
   maximum seven points.

10. Update minimum distance.

11. Return minimum distance.

END
